    <string name="settings_opensky">OpenSky cross-check (observed flights)</string>
    <string name="settings_opensky_body">Free, public ADS-B data: which Condor flights actually departed FRA over the past weeks. Works anonymously, no account or sign-up needed – just switch it on. The app derives an observed timetable from them. Says nothing about availability – always labelled TIMETABLE. Last priority behind every other source, and rate-limited on top of that: OpenSky\'s own anonymous daily credit quota is easy to exhaust, so this only kicks in when nothing else is configured, fetches at most once every few hours, and a lower look-back keeps each fetch cheap. A free OpenSky account (client ID/secret below) raises the limit.</string>
