    <string name="settings_aerodatabox">AeroDataBox (RapidAPI)</string>
    <string name="settings_aerodatabox_body">Real scheduled/live Condor departures and arrivals for the exact weekend you\'re looking at, fetched over RapidAPI. Uses the RapidAPI key above. Ranks ahead of OpenSky in the source order, since this queries an airport\'s actual current schedule rather than reconstructing one from historical observations. The endpoint and response shape below are cross-checked against several public sources rather than fetched from AeroDataBox\'s own docs, so they\'re more confident than most other RapidAPI defaults in this app – but still not a verified contract; correct any field from your own RapidAPI test panel if a real response doesn\'t match.</string>
